<section class="pg on" id="p-about">
  <h1>About</h1>

  <p>
    I am an Avionics Engineering graduate of
    <a href="https://aaub.edu.bd">Aviation and Aerospace University, Bangladesh</a>
    (BSc, March 2026), with a CGPA of 3.52/4.00.
    Antennas, radar and wireless communication are where my curiosity keeps leading me.
  </p>

  <p>
    My undergraduate thesis was a compact
    <b>4-element UWB microstrip MIMO antenna</b>
    that I designed, fabricated and measured.
    Since then I have co-authored papers on patch antennas,
    <b>OTFS waveforms</b> and
    <b>6G integrated sensing and communication (ISAC)</b>,
    and I review manuscripts for the
    <b>IEEE Geoscience and Remote Sensing Society</b>.
    From 2022 to 2025 I was a research assistant on the university rocket project,
    working on its electrical power system.

    <button class="more" id="more" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
      Read more ›
    </button>
  </p>

  <div id="extra">
    <p>
      Outside research I tutored SSC and HSC students in mathematics and science
      from 2019 to 2025, and I served as Outreach Secretary of the AAUB Drone Club.
      I have also trained with the Bangladesh Air Force on aircraft maintenance
      and visited the radar unit of the Civil Aviation Authority of Bangladesh.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>Research focus</h2>

  <p>
    My research connects antenna engineering, radar signal processing and
    next-generation wireless systems. My thesis centred on compact UWB MIMO
    antennas with high isolation. Now I am exploring
    <b>foundation models</b> and <b>agentic learning</b> for radar-native scene
    understanding in 6G ISAC networks, alongside OTFS waveform design.
  </p>

  <h2>Research interest</h2>

  <ul>
    <li><b>Antenna design:</b> UWB, multiband and reconfigurable microstrip patch antennas, MIMO isolation, defected ground structures.</li>
    <li><b>Radar signal processing:</b> Pulse-radar simulation and parameter analysis in MATLAB/Simulink.</li>
    <li><b>6G ISAC:</b> Foundation models and agentic learning for radar-native scene understanding.</li>
    <li><b>Wireless waveforms:</b> OTFS design and implementation, adaptive filtering.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

