      <h3>Undergraduate Thesis: UWB Microstrip Patch Antenna and MIMO</h3>

      <ul>
        <li>
          <b>Method:</b> Designed and fabricated a compact 4-element UWB MIMO
          antenna covering 3.1–10.25 GHz, using spike-shaped radiators and
